# Patch: capability copy payloads and token estimates
# Plugin: ravitemer/mcphub.nvim
# Tested against: 163b3ad [v6.2.0] with local patches 01-10 applied
#
# Problem:
# - `y` copied MCP row names in browse mode, but active tool forms had no copy
#   action for current inputs, submit payloads, or whole results.
# - MCPHub only showed one aggregate prompt token estimate, so server/tool-level
#   prompt cost was hard to inspect.
#
# Fix:
# - Route `y` in active capability mode to the active handler.
# - Track rendered text result lines and copy the whole current result from any
#   selected result row.
# - Copy current tool/prompt input values from input rows and JSON form payloads
#   from submit rows without running validation first. Tool values are
#   schema-converted when valid and left raw when invalid.
# - Add approximate `~Nt` estimates to connected server rows and expanded tool
#   rows, controlled by `ui.token_counts.{enabled,servers,tools}`. Server counts
#   filter out disabled/removed/env-denied tools.
#
# Server build dependency: none. This is client/UI behavior only.

